"See the XTimers Privacy Policy at %1$@xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/privacy.html%2$@." = "Смотрите XTimers Политику конфиденциальности по адресу %1$@xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/privacy.html%2$@.";
